import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 830 | Transcended Ones and Civilization | The Perpetual Mechanism of Civilizational Transmission","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 830 | Transcended Ones and Civilization | The Perpetual Mechanism of Civilizational Transmission","no":830,"module":4,"tags":["Transcended One","Civilization","Civilizational Transmission","Perpetual Mechanism","Alaya Network"],"related":["21-Symbiotic-Network Operating Principles","37-Symbiotic Education System","08-Every-Person-Has-a-Path Guarantee System"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0830_模块4-超脱者与文明-文明传承永续机制.md","filePath":"en/0830_模块4-超脱者与文明-文明传承永续机制.md"}'),s={name:"en/0830_模块4-超脱者与文明-文明传承永续机制.md"};function o(r,e,l,d,c,u){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-830-transcended-ones-and-civilization-the-perpetual-mechanism-of-civilizational-transmission" tabindex="-1">Entry 830 | Transcended Ones and Civilization | The Perpetual Mechanism of Civilizational Transmission <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-830-transcended-ones-and-civilization-the-perpetual-mechanism-of-civilizational-transmission" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 830 | Transcended Ones and Civilization | The Perpetual Mechanism of Civilizational Transmission&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 21, 37, 08</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-civilization-s-greatest-danger-is-not-being-destroyed-by-enemies-but-being-forgotten-by-itself" tabindex="-1">Introduction: civilization&#39;s greatest danger is not being destroyed by enemies, but being forgotten by itself <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-civilization-s-greatest-danger-is-not-being-destroyed-by-enemies-but-being-forgotten-by-itself" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: civilization&#39;s greatest danger is not being destroyed by enemies, but being forgotten by itself&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the old system, civilizational transmission&#39;s method is very primitive: master-apprentice teaching, sect oral-and-heart transmission, book records. This transmission method is extremely fragile — the master dies, the apprentice is not well-taught, knowledge breaks; the sect is extinguished, manuals are lost. Countless civilizations&#39; accumulated wisdom in history vanishes because of transmission mechanisms&#39; fragility. Heng Yuan Zhou upgrades &quot;civilizational transmission&quot; from &quot;fragile oral-heart transmission&quot; to <strong>&quot;perpetual network archiving&quot;</strong> — Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision not only monitor cultivation state, but also undertake permanent storage and Myriad-Rank sharing of civilizational archives.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in this entry centrally embody the collective ascension axiom: Myriad Ranks&#39; historical experience, cultivation results, and civilizational memory may not be lost because of individual life&#39;s end — they must be perpetually transmitted, letting later generations stand on predecessors&#39; shoulders to continue evolution. The anti-predation axiom requires transmitted knowledge not be privately hoarded or monopolized; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires transmitted content be shared by Myriad Ranks; the causal self-discipline axiom requires no distortion of historical facts in transmission; the law-first axiom requires the transmission mechanism itself be law-level infrastructure.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This article focuses: how the transcended one maintains civilizational transmission&#39;s perpetual mechanism.</p><h2 id="i-civilizational-transmission-s-four-layers-of-content" tabindex="-1">I. Civilizational Transmission&#39;s Four Layers of Content <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-civilizational-transmission-s-four-layers-of-content" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Civilizational Transmission&#39;s Four Layers of Content&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Symbiotic-Network Operating Principles (Document 21) and Symbiotic Education System (Document 37), civilizational transmission&#39;s content divides into four layers:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Transmission Layer</th><th>Content</th><th>Storage Location</th><th>Transmission Method</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Layer 1</td><td>Basic cultivation knowledge</td><td>Myriad-Ranks&#39; study (public knowledge library)</td><td>All cultivators freely consult</td></tr><tr><td>Layer 2</td><td>Successive cultivators&#39; enlightenment records</td><td>Alaya Network consciousness archives</td><td>Dao-Origin Realm and above cultivators may deeply study</td></tr><tr><td>Layer 3</td><td>Civilizational historical memory</td><td>Alaya Network civilizational archive library</td><td>After historical review, opened to Myriad Ranks</td></tr><tr><td>Layer 4</td><td>Failure lessons and correction records</td><td>Quest Sediment Domain simulation-review database</td><td>For all cultivators to learn and avoid pitfalls</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Four layers&#39; key is in the fourth layer — <strong>transmission of failure lessons.</strong> In the old system, failures are often covered up, forgotten, ridiculed. Heng Yuan Zhou treats failure as also precious transmission content — because failure lessons better prevent later generations from repeating the same mistakes than success experiences.</p><h2 id="ii-alaya-network-s-archiving-mechanism" tabindex="-1">II. Alaya Network&#39;s Archiving Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-alaya-network-s-archiving-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Alaya Network&#39;s Archiving Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Civilizational transmission&#39;s perpetuity depends on Alaya Network&#39;s archiving mechanism:</p><ul><li><strong>Full recording</strong>: Myriad-Rank cultivators&#39; every major breakthrough, every enlightenment insight, every system experiment are automatically recorded in Alaya Network — does not depend on personal memory; not afraid of individual death;</li><li><strong>Permanent storage</strong>: once archives are deposited, permanently preserved. Does not fade with time, does not lose with plane change;</li><li><strong>Retrievable</strong>: Myriad-Ranks&#39; study&#39;s retrieval system lets later generations quickly find the knowledge they need — does not require &quot;finding a good teacher&quot; to learn;</li><li><strong>Verifiable</strong>: every enlightenment record has Alaya Network&#39;s timestamp and source marker — later generations may verify whether this knowledge is real, avoiding false-knowledge spread.</li></ul><p>Full, permanent, retrievable, verifiable — four traits together turn civilizational transmission from &quot;fragile person-to-person transmission&quot; into &quot;reliable network-store network-fetch.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-the-transcended-one-s-duties-in-the-transmission-mechanism" tabindex="-1">III. The Transcended One&#39;s Duties in the Transmission Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-transcended-one-s-duties-in-the-transmission-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Transcended One&#39;s Duties in the Transmission Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s duties in civilizational transmission&#39;s perpetual mechanism:</p><ul><li><strong>Archive guardianship</strong>: guard civilizational archives stored in Alaya Network — prevent archives from being tampered, deleted, privatized. This is consciousness-domain maintenance&#39;s core task (see entry 806);</li><li><strong>Historical review</strong>: review archives involving sensitive historical events (such as civilizational-correction records, historical-regression events) — ensure public historical records are true, complete, not beautified or uglified;</li><li><strong>Education-system maintenance</strong>: maintain the Symbiotic Education System&#39;s infrastructure — ensure young cultivators have channels to access these archives, have mentors guiding them to correctly understand archives;</li><li><strong>Transmission-quality gatekeeping</strong>: ensure transmitted knowledge is verified and high-quality — prevent false knowledge, outdated knowledge, one-sided knowledge from misleading later generations in transmission.</li></ul><p>Four duties&#39; core: <strong>the transcended one is civilizational memory&#39;s guardian, not civilizational memory&#39;s editor.</strong> He does not modify history, does not beautify failure, does not delete lessons — he lets history keep its true face, letting later generations themselves judge and learn.</p><h2 id="iv-why-transmission-must-be-perpetual-civilization-s-compound-interest-effect" tabindex="-1">IV. Why Transmission Must Be &quot;Perpetual&quot;: Civilization&#39;s Compound-Interest Effect <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-why-transmission-must-be-perpetual-civilization-s-compound-interest-effect" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Why Transmission Must Be &quot;Perpetual&quot;: Civilization&#39;s Compound-Interest Effect&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Civilizational transmission&#39;s perpetuity is backed by a deep logic: <strong>civilization&#39;s progress is a compound-interest effect.</strong> Each generation of cultivators moves forward on the previous generation&#39;s knowledge foundation; knowledge accumulation&#39;s speed is not addition, but multiplication.</p><ul><li>If transmission breaks — the previous generation&#39;s knowledge is lost; the next generation starts from zero; civilization always spins in place;</li><li>If transmission is perpetual — the previous generation&#39;s knowledge is fully transmitted to the next generation; the next generation accelerates evolution on predecessors&#39; foundation; civilization develops exponentially.</li></ul><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s civilizational-transmission perpetual mechanism is to ensure this compound-interest effect is not interrupted. Alaya Network&#39;s permanent archiving lets every generation of cultivators stand on all predecessors&#39; shoulders — no matter which race, which plane, which epoch predecessors were from. This is &quot;every person has a path&quot; at the time dimension&#39;s fulfillment: <strong>not only does every person have a path in space, but every generation has a path in time.</strong></p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: perpetual archiving avoids &quot;every generation starts from zero&quot; repeated-exploration waste; civilizational knowledge&#39;s compound-interest effect makes every generation of cultivators doubly efficient</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: full publication + permanent storage institutionally seal the predatory channels of &quot;knowledge private hoarding&quot; and &quot;secret-manual monopoly&quot;</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo knowledge relies on sect oral teaching and protagonist opportunities; may be lost at any time; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s civilizational knowledge is perpetually archived in Alaya Network; Myriad Ranks may retrieve at any time</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: four transmission layers open to all Myriad-Rank cultivators; each clan&#39;s historical memory and enlightenment records are all archived</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: four transmission layers, archiving mechanism, and transcended-one duties are all publicly queryable; Myriad Ranks may supervise transmission&#39;s completeness</p></li><li><p>Terminology alignment: the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm is this batch&#39;s standard realm appellation; the transcended one&#39;s civilizational weight dynamically adjusts with post performance; the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle ensures energy and knowledge circulate perpetually among Myriad Ranks; exercise of law-anchor authority is strictly constrained by four-dimensional assessment and democratic procedure.</p></li><li><p><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Civilizational transmission&#39;s perpetual mechanism is the collective ascension axiom&#39;s institutional fulfillment at the time dimension. The transcended one guards civilizational archives in Alaya Network — Myriad Ranks&#39; cultivation knowledge, enlightenment records, historical memory, failure lessons. He does not let history be tampered, does not let knowledge be privately hoarded, does not let lessons be forgotten. When this perpetual mechanism runs normally, civilization does not lose any accumulation because of individual life&#39;s end — every generation moves forward on all predecessors&#39; shoulders. This is the words &quot;perpetual&quot; in civilizational transmission&#39;s true meaning: <strong>civilization does not die, not because it is forever young, but because it forever remembers.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">Entry 21 · Symbiotic-Network Operating Principles</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/37-共生教育体系.html">Entry 37 · Symbiotic Education System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/08-人人有路保障体系.html">Entry 08 · Every-Person-Has-a-Path Guarantee System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/826_模块4-超脱者与文明-总论.html">Entry 826 · Transcended Ones and Civilization Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const p=i(s,[["render",o]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
